window.products.push({"id":950014,"name":"hecef Cheese Board set of 3,a Acacia Wood Cheese Plate & a Cheese Knife & a Cheese Fork, Cheese Platter Slate Board Cheese Serving Board, Mothers Day ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Oy72KhnoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Acacia Wood: Hecef's premium acacia wood is known for its rich, contrasting colour and natural lustre. Cheese Board Set will last a life time when treated properly. Acacia wood is extremely durable and by rubbing a little mineral oil into the natural wood surface on a regular basis, your product will look like new for years to come. Easy to Clean: Acacia wood is more hygienic than glass or plastic boards, and it is less likely to be split or warped. The smooth surface avoid splotch from attaching to the cheese plate, making it extremely easy to clean. Plus, it is recommended to hang it up after cleaning so as to dry for next use. Functional: The sturdy design of the board can also be used to prepare and serve sandwiches, soups, fruits. You also can use it as your food prep cutting board. And the sturdy handle makes transporting easy. Cheese Board Features: A 12 x 8.7 x 0.5inches cutting and serving acacia cheese board. The handle of cheese board is designed for Easy to Carry. The grommet on the handle allows the board to be hung while not in use. The Cheese Board Set has a large cutting surface, allowing cheeses, sandwiches, breads, grapes and chutneys to place on it together. Make a Perfect Gift - Give this beautifully designed set to someone you love, for Christmas, birthdays, housewarming parties, weddings, engagements, baby showers, wine and cheese tastings, and many other events. Impress your guests at your next social gathering with the elegant grain finish and acacia wood color of this beautiful cheese board.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Oy72KhnoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"hecef","source_asin":"B078HK5J17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950014","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078HK5J17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078HK5J17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
