window.products.push({"id":950021,"name":"NARWAL T10 Mop Robot, 4-in-1 Robot Vacuum and Mop with Self Cleaning Station, Self Washing and Drying Robot Mop with LiDAR Navigation, Smart Mapping, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":799.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51w71edpsyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🟣4-in-1 Automatic Sweep, Mop, Wash, and Dry: Say goodbye to the tedious manual work of mop washing and drying. Besides the sweeping work, Narwal mop robot will efficiently wash, rinse and dry your mops automatically. The unique mop system features self-cleaning technology so you never have a dirty mop. Powerful suction and a no-roll brush design to reduce the risk of hair tangling 🟣The Real Deep Cleaner: Few robot mops are deep cleaners considering the streaks left on the floor. Narwal does an excellent job at mopping with its revolutionary high-speed spinning mopping system. Bring out the spotless shine of your floors with this mopping robot. Vinyl, tile, laminate, hardwood floors, marble...Narwal will impress you by eliminating stains and wet spots in an instant 🟣No Need for Manual Washing and Drying: Free your hands and time from washing and drying the mop pads. This self-cleaning mopping robot periodically returns to its base station to clean its microfiber mops on its own. It knows when to wash the mop pads and dries them when cleaning is done. The built-in 5L(1.3 gallons) water tanks mean the mop robot t is able to clean 3000 ft² 🟣The Lowest Noise Ever & Lidar Navigation: The 45dB noise is lower than most robot vacuum mops, no disturb to pets and kids even at night. Thanks to the Lidar Navigation, Narwal features fast learning of the environment and optimizing cleaning routine instead of aimlessly spinning around. With multiple smart sensors, the robot mop avoids obstacles with ease and tackles tough terrain effortlessly 🟣Smart Mapping and No-Go Zones: Freely choose the room or area you want to clean, and set the cleaning sequence as well. This mopping robot also allows you to adjust vacuuming suction levels and mopping moisture levels. Define no-go zones to build virtual barriers for mopping or vacuuming as you wish. No-go zones can be stored for all future auto-scheduled runs 🟣Note: The supported network of Narwal T10 is 2.4G WiFi. However, since most routers support both 2.4G and 5G, in order to ensure the machine's stability, it is recommended to switch to 2.4G WiFi when using the robot by following the instructions of your router setup","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51w71edpsyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NARWAL","source_asin":"B08Z75576H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950021","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z75576H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z75576H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
