window.products.push({"id":950109,"name":"Howard Miller Thatcher Wall Clock 625-623 – Oversized Metal and Wood with Quartz Movement","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":369.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KkdVCTqYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WALL CLOCK: The Thatcher Wall Clock features aged metal and wooden outer frame to compliment your home decor. The clock’s quartz movement makes a soft ticking noise without the use of chimes for a quieter environment. DURABLE: This oversized modern clock is created to last. It has a sturdy frame to relieve stress in a busy household. Display it in your kitchen, office, bathroom, bedroom, living room, and more for a large classic decorative piece. HIGH QUALITY: This clock will quickly become a home essential. Easily tell time with wooden traditional Roman numerals (IIII instead of IV) applied to aged, rusty brown metal rings, and aged brown diamond cut hands. DIMENSIONS: The diameter of this clock is 32.25 inches (82 inches) and the depth is 2 inches (5 cm). It is powered by quartz movement and requires one AA sized battery (not included). HOWARD MILLER: Founded in 1926 and still family-owned in its third generation, Howard Miller is the world’s leading clock company and a respected brand name in fine specialty furnishings such as curio cabinets, wine and bar furnishings, custom storage cabinets, and SmartMoves adjustable height desks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KkdVCTqYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B01LBDKQDU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950109","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LBDKQDU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LBDKQDU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":950110,"name":"20 Oz Portable Blender USB Rechargeable, Supkitdin Waterproof Personal Blender for Shakes and Smoothies, with 6 Ultra-sharp Blades for Travel, Office ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7100iFfxcrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【20 Oz Larger Capacity】After studying the market of portable blenders, we found out the majority of them come with the capacity of 12, 13.5, 14, 15, 17 Oz, which fail to produce adequate juices to meet personal need,as a result, users have to blend again and again; So we make this new personal blender with larger capacity of 20 Oz(600ml),only single one blending could provide enough juices for one person. 【240W Powerful Smoothie Blender】We made lots of test to improved the structure of the stainless steel 3D blades to make them less likely get stuck by fruits or vegetables during the blending process. Meanwhile, we equip this smoothie blender with 240W high speed motor with a rotating speed of 24,000 times per minutes, it can easily crush through SMALL ice cube and frozen fruit, bringing you a cup of smoothie or juice within 30s! 【Water-proof USB Rechargeable Port】Built-in 4000mAh rechargeable battery, this portable blender could serve 15 cups of juice after a single charge; Its Type-C charging port is water-proof design, you can charge it by AC adapter, power bank, computer or other USB power source, no worry about liquid get inside, and you can immerse it in water about 10 minutes, very convenient to clean. 【Lightweight & Portable Design】Only weights 1.37 lbs, this portable blender comes with anti-slip lanyard, you can put it into a backpack, gym bag and suitcase, and blend and enjoy fresh juices whether at the office, gym, camping, school or while traveling. 【Safe And Reliable】Supkitdin portable blender is made of BPA-free, eco-friendly, PCTG good-grade materials. For the user's safety, the blender only works when the cup part and the base are assembled correctly and tightly. Meanwhile, for 100% customer satisfaction, Supkitdin provides 7/24 customer services and a 90-day money-back guarantee. Just feel free to contact us if you have any questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7100iFfxcrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Supkitdin","source_asin":"B0BZJM97GP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950110","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZJM97GP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZJM97GP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":950111,"name":"OrganicTextiles Natural Australian Wool Filled Comforter (Crib Size, Heavyweight), with 100% Organic Cotton Covering, Skin Sensitive, Baby Bedding","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":154.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51krSoztIxL._AC_SL1422_.jpg","description":"AUSTRALIAN WOOL FILLING: 100% Fine Aussie Wool filling that adheres to strict regulations given by the country to give you the safest best wool. All-Natural wool helps better wick away moisture to Regulate Temperature since it’s not treated with any harmful sprays or ingredients and retains its natural fibers. 100% ANIMAL CRUELTY-FREE. 100% ORGANIC COTTON COVER: Covered with an All-Organic Cotton Sateen cover for a Luxurious Look. Original cotton fiber quality with a soft feel and a more durable cover. SKIN SENSITIVE: Our wool comforter is made with All-Natural Ingredients to give you nothing but a Pure Healthy Sleeping Environment. 350 THREAD COUNT: Woven with a higher thread count than our competitors to offer a softer bed comforter. Plus, adding a silky feel and luxurious look with our organic cotton sateen cover. Easy-Care: Corner Ties (loop corners) anchor to duvet cover and prevent shifting or bunching up; heavyweight, 400 GSM. The Thickness is .75\" thick.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51krSoztIxL._AC_SL1422_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORGANIC TEXTILES","source_asin":"B09GR5T5RL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GR5T5RL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GR5T5RL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
