window.products.push({"id":950123,"name":"Queen Modern Upholstered Platform Bed Frame with LED Lights Wave-Like Curve Led Bed Frame with Headboard Faux Leather Low Profile Bed Frame Queen Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lU+WnzqhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Unique Wave Like Curve Design】DICTAC Modern led bed rame is covered by durable Faux PU Leather for ultimate comfort and looks, showcasing a futuristic design.As the same time,wave Like Curve and Low Profile Upholstered design is soft and anti-collision,keep your family safe.Recommend the mattress thickness of 8-14 inches. 【Bed Frame with LED Lights 】Our Upholstered LED Platform Bed Frame uses smart RGB led light bars, it located under the wood frames on three sides of the bed, by remote control or mobile app.Over 60000 colors can choose, you also freely set the brightness,speed , mode and timing function.The smart music sync function makes the LED light color and flashing mode will change with the music rhythm for an immersive home concert experience. 【Keep a Quiet Sleep】Velcro slats design, simplify the installation steps of the slats and offer stability between slats and foundation to eliminate the friction noise from the root cause.3 adjustable feet, even if your floor is uneven, you can adjust the height of the feet to make the bed more stable and keep quiet. Very little friction between the wooden slats and the solid wood frame to prevent noise, reduce wood slats wear and extend the life of the Low Profile bed frame. 【Stability and Durable】The wave like curve led bed frame with strong solid wooden connecting frame and 14 closely spaced wooden slats, can better distribute weight and protect your mattress from sagging giving your various types of mattresses the support it needs without the box spring. Plus 9 sturdy legs to ensure the durability and stability of the upholstered platform bed frame,create a quiet sleeping environment and provide strong support easily up to 900 LBS. 【Quick & Easy Assembly】Our modern upholstered led bed frame comes with detailed instruction, assembly tools and numbered parts, only take 45 minutes to assemble even for a rookie.🌞【Excellent Service】If you have any problem after receiving the queen Size platform bed frame, please feel free to contact us,DCTAC always replies and solve your problem within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lU+WnzqhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DICTAC","source_asin":"B0BDRWKTN1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950123","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDRWKTN1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDRWKTN1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":950124,"name":"Signature Housewares Sorrento Collection 120-Ounce Large Mixing Bowl, Ruby Antiqued Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7134OXJEgjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The perfect way to add to your Signature Sorrento collection! Equip a new apartment, home, even dorm room with this 120-ounce medium mixing bowl in ruby. This mix bowl is perfect for both baking and cooking alike. A steadfast collection that is sure to please, all Sorrento pieces the signature rim design and are available in an array of colors. With dinner plates, salad plates, bowls and a multitude of additional serving and cooking accessories, you can build your collection over time. The 100 percent lead-free stoneware is durable enough to withstand the microwave and dishwasher for years of everyday use. For cooking and baking, the Sorrento mixing bowls are made to last! Amazon.com Created by tableware designer and gourmet chef Debbie Segura in 2001, Sorrento is perhaps Signature Houseware's most popular dinnerware pattern. Sorrento stoneware suits almost any kitchen décor with its rustic, Italian countryside feel, showing a raised dot and olive leaf patterning on most of the solid-colored, thickly-glazed pieces. Square plates are also available, and bakeware and glassware complete the extensive collection, now available in more than half a dozen colors ranging from neutral suede to bright ruby red. The largest of three nesting Sorrento mixing bowls, this one measures 10 inches in diameter and holds up to 120 ounces, or nearly four quarts, ideal for mixing a batch of cookies or serving a party-sized tossed green salad. All three mixing bowls feature a different exterior pattern. The rim band on the large bowl, which helps provides grip, is embossed with an almost floral-like olive leaf motif, while vertical bands of raised lines and dots decorate the sides. Alone or with the two smaller mixing bowls, this attractive and functional bowl makes a great gift for someone who is building a Sorrento collection. Completely lead-free, the durable, chip-resistant stoneware is safe for use in the microwave, dishwasher, and conventional oven for warming. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7134OXJEgjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Signature Housewares","source_asin":"B000NTZJ86","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950124","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000NTZJ86","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000NTZJ86","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
