window.products.push({"id":950148,"name":"Enhance the Style of Your Fireplace with a Condar Mesh Screen. Fireplace Mesh Screen Curtain. 18\" High. Includes 2 Panels, each 24\" Wide.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":66.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MZUZu7XYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Enhance the style of your fireplace with a Condar mesh screen. Condar’s attractive fireplace mesh screens make your fireplace the center piece of any room. Functional, visually appealing, and made to last. All Condar screen packages include: Two panels, totaling 48 inches wide.19 gauge steel mesh.1/4 inch openings in the mesh.1/2 inch hanger rings.Matte black finish.A pair of matching Cool Grip screen pulls.All screen packages include two panels, totaling 48 inches wide. This is sufficient for an attractive natural drape effect on most fireplaces and inserts. Standard screen sizes range from 16 inches through 36 inches tall.How to choose the right size screen for your fireplace:Just measure the height and width of your current screen (not including hanger rings) and order the same height screen. Condar's hanger rings will add half inch (1 cm) to total height.Buying a screen and already have a rod installed? If you already have a rod installed, measure the height of your fireplace opening to the top of the rod. Subtract ½ inch (1 cm) for the hanger rings below the rod, and approximately ½ inch (1 cm) for clearance at the bottom (1 inch: 3 cm total). Condar fireplace screens do not include a rod.If you don’t have a fireplace screen rod installed, choose the Rod and Valance Kit (ASIN: B0039ZD9O2). IMPORTANT: When ordering both Rod and Valance Kit and screen choose a screen size 2 inches (5 cm) shorter than the height of your fireplace opening (this accounts for hanger rings and clearance at the bottom).Now available in Stainless Steel (Amazon ASIN: B01NA0C39E).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MZUZu7XYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Condar","source_asin":"B000HPNV2M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000HPNV2M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000HPNV2M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
