window.products.push({"id":950160,"name":"Atemws Silicone Trivet for Hot Pots and Pans Kitchen Heat Resistant Mat Honeycomb Pot Holders 4 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MBTPegifL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Essential Kitchenware: Silicone trivet protects countertop and tabletops from hot pans and dishes. It has the perfect size as trivet, jar opener, spoon rest, pot holder, hot mitts, hot pads, cold drink coasters and garlic peeler. It works well for removing dishes from microwave or setting pots from stove or grab pans out of the oven without burning hands. It not only heat protection on surfaces, non slip protection when placed under breakables, and awesome for removing stubborn lids on jars. Food Grade Silicone Material: They're soft and flexible enough to grab hot pans, 0.24inch/60mm thick enough to insulate your countertop against hot items and protect your hands. It can stand coldest -105 °F to heatest 446 °F. and doesn't melt or stick to the pan. Honeycomb Design: Silicone pot holders honeycomb pattern is on both sides and nice feel to it plus the extra thickness helps to prevent heat when placing a hot pot on it, it also makes dishes cooling faster. The small hexagonal shapes traps liquids and prevents small spills from getting on the counter, it doesn’t leak. Easy to Clean and Store: Silicone trivet mats hot pads take up less space easy to store. The hook makes it easy to hang up. They wash easily if anything spills on them, hand wash or throw in the dishwasher, shaking after washing and let it air dry. Our Service and 2 Years Guarantee: Atemws high quality trivets for hot pots and pans is no regret to buy, we are so confident you will love it, If you had any issues with it, no matter the timing, just let us know we will give you best solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MBTPegifL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Atemws","source_asin":"B08HPTW6PD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HPTW6PD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HPTW6PD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
