window.products.push({"id":950199,"name":"Maverick ET-735 Bluetooth 4.0 Wireless Digital Cooking Thermometer, Monitors 4 Probes Simultaneously","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i60NXXcIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing the latest thermometer from Maverick. With Bluetooth connectivity, up to 4-probe simultaneous monitoring, 15 total temperature presets, smart temp and range alerts, a backlit display and much more, this is the ultimate BBQ thermometer. The next-generation Thermometer. The Maverick ET-735 is the most advanced BBQ thermometer available on the market. It's reliable Bluetooth connectivity, which, along with the FREE companion Redi-Chek app, turns your Bluetooth LE 4.0-capable smart device into a powerful remote cooking device and BBQ data receiver. With the app, you can set all food temps, set cooking timers, monitor the cooking progress, and receive smart alerts. The ET-735 sports 4 inputs for a total of 4 probes. You can thus monitor 4 independent temperatures on your iOS or Android device. The unit itself is rainproof, and the two included 36-inch probes are waterproof and heat-resistant. When you're smoking a few meats together, you can, for example, monitor 1) the temperature of the smoker chamber, 2) the inside temperature of the meat, 3) the inside temp of the chicken, and 4) the inside temp of the pork. And all this, with just one Device. Compatible Dvice List For iOS iPhone 4S iPhone 5 iPhone 5C iPhone 5S iPhone 6 iPhone 6 plus iPad (3rd generation) ipad (4th generation) iPad Air iPad Air 2 iPad mini iPad mini 2 iPad mini 3 iPod touch (5th generation) Andriod Samsung Galaxy S4 Samsung Galaxy S4 mini Samsung Galaxy S5 Samsung Note 2 Samsung Note 3 Motorola Moto G","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i60NXXcIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maverick","source_asin":"B00THCADP4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00THCADP4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00THCADP4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
