window.products.push({"id":950256,"name":"ClassicFlame Enterprise Lite Contemporary TV Stand for TVs up to 80\", Gloss Black (Electric Fireplace Insert sold separately)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tcuImrc+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This stylish, contemporary TV stand accommodates most flat screen TVs up to 80\" or up to 155 lbs. It features a High Gloss Black finish, partitioned storage compartment for electronic components, smoked tempered glass doors, and stainless steel legs. This TV stand complements a ClassicFlame 26\" electric fireplace insert (sold separately). Simple, hassle-free assembly with just a Phillips head screwdriver.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tcuImrc+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ClassicFlame","source_asin":"B00K75SJ10","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00K75SJ10","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00K75SJ10","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":950257,"name":"Dyson DC41 Upright Ball Vacuum (Certified Refurbished)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314AyQqnj4L._AC_.jpg","description":"This certified refurbished Dyson DC41 Upright Ball Vacuum is engineered for outstanding cleaning performance and ease of use. It has the strongest suction at the cleaner head, which automatically self-adjusts for different carpet lengths and hard floors. The DC41 features Dyson’s latest Radial Root Cyclone technology, Ball technology for smooth steering, and a large 0.55-gallon bin. Ball technology for upright vacuums Dyson Ball upright vacuums ride on a ball, which pivots on the spot so you can steer with a turn of the wrist. The ball also houses core technology, including the motor and ducting. There’s less clutter, so it’s easier to clean in awkward places, along edges, and around furniture. Strongest suction at the cleaner head Many upright vacuums use fixed settings, and their cleaner heads don’t self-adjust to different floor types. The bigger the gap between cleaner head and floor, the more suction power is wasted. With the DC41, an active base plate creates the optimal cleaner head contact for every floor type, reducing air leaks and retaining more suction power. It’s designed for outstanding performance across all floors--not just carpets. Powerful and durable The DC41 is constructed from materials selected for strength, flexibility, and tolerance. Many parts are made from polypropylene reinforced with 20 percent glass fibers and high-impact PC-ABS. Using these materials means greater strength from less plastic, so the machine is lightweight. Motorized brush bar Stiff nylon bristles spin at up to 90 times per second to agitate carpet pile and dislodge ground-in dirt and pet hair, and the brush bar can be turned off to protect delicate rugs and hard floors. Captures allergens and expels cleaner air Unlike ordinary vacuums that can’t always retain all the dust they remove, venting some of it back into your room in the air they expel,  the DC41 captures and contains microscopic particles such as pollen, mold and bacteria. Hygienic and quick to empty Emptying the bin on a Dyson vacuum is quick and hygienic. The bin is clear, so you can see when it needs emptying and how much dust, dirt, and pet hair the machine has captured. Just press the release button to empty the bin.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314AyQqnj4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon Renewed","source_asin":"B00KO8685Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KO8685Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KO8685Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":950258,"name":"Fourth of July Americana Mixed Red White & Blue Berry & Pip Berry Garland - Patriotic Flag Color Berries for Decorating Table Arrangements, Fireplace ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JmN4z5g8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Summertime and Home Decor Made Easy. This Artificial Americana Mixed Berries and Pip Berry Garland in red, white and blue is perfect for adding patriotic color to any space. Use the rustic garland to decorate a fireplace mantel, atop kitchen cabinets, or as a table centerpiece Size: 48 inches long (end to end) Flexible - The garland has a hand wrapped center core and branches that makes it flexible and easy to be shaped and styled. The red, white, and navy blue berries are perfect for adding a rustic Americana touch to 4th of July, Memorial Day or Patriotic decorations. Not only a garland, use it to create pip berry wreaths, great for adding to floral arrangement creations, wreaths, or to decorate grapevine displays, Cut into smaller sections to add to your wall pockets, baskets, or other containers Easy to Display - With round berries and smaller pip berries, the garland is perfect for any decor, including classic, traditional, farmhouse, country, or primitive. It is perfect for arranging across a fireplace mantel, placing it amongst your Christmas tree branches, or zigzagging it down a dining or buffet table. A great choice for year-round decor, it can be used this year, then stored and reused for future use year after year. Please note: We love our berries, and we know you will too. However, they require a bit of care to keep them looking beautiful. This garland is designed for indoor or covered outdoor use. Exposure to water or dampness may result in the berries being damaged. We also recommend not placing berry products in direct sunlight as excessive heat and sunlight may result in fading.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JmN4z5g8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Factory Direct Craft","source_asin":"B0BNJYH1W5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950258","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNJYH1W5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNJYH1W5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
