window.products.push({"id":950272,"name":"Clearco Decorative Mask STAND for African and Tribal Masks, Artifacts, Dolls, Statues, for displays, shows and art exhibits. MASK NOT INCLUDED.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814c8jxEzYS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"12\"H T-arms can be bent to hold masks. These are more rigid then other \"T\"-arms and are NOT softenend. These are harder to bend but will support more weight. As some have found, that bending too many times may break the stand, as it is made to be bent for one mask only. Tools, like pliers, may be helpful to the \"do it yourself\" process, and avoid direct pressure on the weld as the wire will be stronger than the weld. Also, touch up paint may be needed to cover marks or finish removed during the process. These come un-assembled and require either a hammer to tap the \"T\" into the base or if a little loose than a little glue to tighten the post. The \"T\" is easier to bend and work with when not in the base. The base may have a PROTECTIVE film to be REMOVED. There is also a video that may be helpful as well.The upright is about 1/4\". The top bar is about 1/8\" x about 11\" across. The base is .5\" acrylic x 7\" x 7\" black. This is a display stand - MASK NOT INCLUDED. Old item number TA-127B","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814c8jxEzYS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Clearco","source_asin":"B08W7BV8GV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W7BV8GV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W7BV8GV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
