window.products.push({"id":950420,"name":"Tibetan Sandalwood Incense for Meditation and Yoga Hand Rolled Fair Trade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ax1SI9IbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sandalwood is a prevalent fragrance to use as an offering to the Buddha. It is thought to stir the spirituality within and signifies perseverance or joyous efforts. Great incense for meditation, yoga, healing, relaxation and spiritual offerings. This special blend combines the finest all natural sandalwood with 100% pure herbs to create a robust Sandalwood aroma.  The preparation of traditional incense is one of the oldest medicinal practices of Tibet. Each stick is hand rolled with the purest sacred ingredients that releases its strong aromatherapy when burned; it is through our sense of smell that we can feel its powerful healing effects. Kindly Note: organic incense does not have a stick in the middle as it is made from 100% pure herbs. Unfortunately, this means incense won’t fit standard holes in most burners. If you don’t have the proper vessel, you can make one by pouring a small amount of sand/salt into a ceramic bowl/cup, lay incense on top and burn. If needed, you can easily break the sticks into smaller pieces or simply push into the soil of a plant. Please burn responsibly. The biggest benefit to not having a wooden stick in the center is the guarantee you are inhaling only the purest quality medicinal herbs and sacred ingredients. Mindfully sourced using Fair Trade practices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ax1SI9IbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mindful Market","source_asin":"B074J4YK6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950420","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074J4YK6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074J4YK6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
