window.products.push({"id":950465,"name":"ETECHMART Bamboo Corner Shower Stool for Shaving Legs Foot Rest, Waterproof Bath Bench Seat with Storage Shelf and Soap Dish for Bathroom Inside Showe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JFzu6Yl3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌲SPACE SAVING CORNER DESIGN: This innovative shower bench adopts a right-angle design which is a perfect solution for small corners. Whether you use it as a shaving legs stool or a corner bench, it will fit in with room to spare. 🌲EXTRA BAMBOO SOAP DISH & HOOKS: Comes with a bamboo soap dish, size: 5×3 inch. The soap holder with self draining design and waterproof coating on the surface. 2pcs stainless steel hooks can be used to hang bath balls, brushes, towels and other toiletries. They are both detachable, and you can use them in other places according to your needs. 🌲STYLISH LOOK & EXQUISITE WORKMANSHIP: Add a chic look to your shower with this modern and stylish stool. Designed with a handy storage shelf that can hold a large variety of your bath and shower supplies. The guardrail design can prevent your products from falling. The shower stool has a delicate touch, polished edges and smooth surface without burrs. Our corner stool can hold up to 150 pounds. 🌲MULTIFUNCTIONAL: This corner shower bench with 2-tier storage shelf can hold various bath items and easily fits wherever you need it, bathroom, living room, bedroom, entryway, spa, sauna, balcony, patio, also serves as shoe bench, plant stand, etc. Great for toiletries, linens, flower pots, magazines, books ,etc. 🌲WATERPROOF: The corner shower stool is made of 100% natural bamboo which is more friendly than wood and other synthetic materials. Applied with waterproof paint features excellent water resistance and the slatted surface good for draining water and dissipating heat which will ensure long-term use and extend the service life. 🌲100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: If you are unsatisfied with our product, please contact us freely and our professional customer service team will be happy to provide you with your choice of replacement or refund. Please purchase ETECHMART products with confidence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JFzu6Yl3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ETECHMART","source_asin":"B0C1RB93SN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1RB93SN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1RB93SN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
