window.products.push({"id":950540,"name":"3 Pack Colorful Metal Toothpicks - Stainless Steel Reusable Toothpicks with Knurled Grip - Sleek and Sturdy Metal Teeth Picks - Versatile Fruit Picker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JmqJU34CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You’ll Wonder How You Lived Without Them You’ve just finished gobbling up that hearty meal but you’re not desperately searching for a toothpick like before. That food stuck in your teeth isn’t driving you up the wall. Because you’ve got the C and C Adventures metal toothpick pack in your pocket! It comes with 3 metal tooth picks, each thoughtfully sized at 2.6” to stay by your side wherever you go. Tired of wooden toothpicks breaking and plastic ones bending? You’ve found picks that are crafted to practically last a lifetime. We’ve brought the metal toothpicks to life using food-grade stainless steel and made compliments an everyday affair with the multi-colored design. Sleek and elegant, these metal teeth picks turn the most mundane of activities into a polished statement. Product Specifications: ✔ Color: Multiple Colors ✔ Material: Stainless Steel ✔ Pick Dimensions: 2.6” (L) Inches Package Inclusions: ✔ 3 x Metal Toothpicks packaged inside a convenient plastic tube that makes a great carrying case Discover A World of Versatility There’s more to this set than just clearing the evidence of your ravenous pursuits. You can use the picks as metal cocktail toothpicks for a touch of elegance, or as package openers that rip through tape & cardboard with ease. Look closer and you’ll see the secret behind our picks’ versatility. The ends are knurled for a great grip, while the tips are smooth enough to confidently use in your mouth yet fine enough to handle fruits and packages. And when you’re in the middle of your camping trip, deep in the wilderness soaking up the great outdoors, you’ll never be burdened with the guilt of tossing disposable toothpicks away. Get a couple more sets as gifts and spread the convenience!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JmqJU34CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"C and C Adventures","source_asin":"B07MRCC3M4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MRCC3M4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MRCC3M4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
