window.products.push({"id":950562,"name":"Heidi Galaxy Star Bed Canopy Single Sleeper Bunk Bed Curtain Student Dormitory Blackout Cloth Mosquito Nets Bedding Tent","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710UByi92jL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Instructions: Each cloth contains 2.5M cotton rope and 7pcs C shape hanging hooks. Buy single cloth for shading the front or the back of bunk bed. Buy two cloth for shading the front with two sides, or shading the back with two sides. Buy 3 cloth for shading all the four sides (excluding top ). Note: Please check picture notes and order the right quantity according to your need. How to install the bed curtain? For example install to the top bunk bed(Not include the rod ) 1.Fix the two 2.5m ropes to four corners along bunk frame edge. 2.Fix the 5m ropes to four corners of the bunk frame by crossing it. 3.Pull hanging rings through holes of curtain cloths(have hole on the brim),the clip them to the two 2.5m rope. 4.Place the dust proof(no holes) on to the crossing rope. Feature: 100% Brand new and excellent quality. -Sensitive to light when you sleep. Black out the world with the Perfect Roommate. -Great shading effect,protect your privacy very well and provide you a quiet and comfortable sleep -Simply hang the Black Out Canopy and you have an instant room, for a work desk, office, TV, work out place, privacy,etc. 100% Guarantee: Would you encounter any problems, please email to us and we will try our best to meet your satisfaction!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710UByi92jL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"heidi.com","source_asin":"B07TVBV7BN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950562","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TVBV7BN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TVBV7BN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
