window.products.push({"id":950678,"name":"Pepetools w/ 4:1 Reduction Gear Box Ultra Series 90MM Combination Rolling Mill","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":639.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y1+jeWCFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing the world's best known rolling mill, the \"ultra\" series line of rolling Mills by Pepe tools. pepetools engineered a unique housing that maximizes durability and increases strength, all while decreasing overall mass. Thanks to a new generation of precision machining, pepetools \"ultra\" series rolling Mills are stronger than ever. Frames are fashioned from high strength iron so that the total weight of each mill could be reduced to save on shipping costs. Standard on each mill is a high performance 4:1 reduction gear box turned with a high strength forged steel handle. Gears are not cast but are hobbled from solid steel. Each roll is precision machined from select grades of high density steel. After the machining process is completed, each roll is hardened to 65 hrs. in strategic locations utilizing the latest in induction heat treating methods made in USA rolling mill comes with a 12 month limited factory warranty. Don't miss the opportunity to have this item in your shop. The Half-Round grooves are machined into the upper roll and are used to form Half-Round wire often used to fabricate ring shanks. The 4 square grooves form wire into a profile that is roughly square in profile. Wire so formed is then passed through a drawplate to create round wire or other wire profiles. Holes are provided in the base of the mill for bolting to your workbench. • dimensions: 8-3/4 inch W x 6-3/4 inch d deep x 11-1/4 inch H • gear reduction: 4:1 • shipping weight: 37 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y1+jeWCFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pepe Tools","source_asin":"B01LW55GQM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950678","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LW55GQM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LW55GQM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
