window.products.push({"id":950760,"name":"Andency Jersey Knit Duvet Cover King (104 x 90 Inch), 3 Pieces (1 Solid Dark Grey Duvet Cover, 2 Pillowcases) Soft and Breathable Cotton Duvet Cover S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eJSLj5BKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Jersey Duvet Cover Set Made from 100% Cotton Pillow insert, duvet insert or comforter is not included. [SOFT DUVET COVER] With selected jersey knit cotton, this cozy duvet cover is super soft and skin-friendly, warm and comfortable, just like your favorite close-fitting T-shirt. After a tiring day, snuggling down, this breathable duvet cover can bring you a perfect comfy sleep all night, every part of you will relax like you are in clouds. Durable than natural cotton and healthier than microfiber, NO odor or itchy, the best for naked sleeper. Jersey duvet cover is not easy to pill or wrinkle. [SOLID DESIGN & SUPERB SEWING] Classic solid color design, simple and generous, suitable for various decoration styles, is also the best choice for hotels. Fabulous selected color by professional artists, elegant and soothing, adds a layer of warmth and casual look to your room. We use advanced yarn-dyed sewing technology, which is environmentally friendly and fade-resistant compared to similar products. [HIDDEN ZIPPER & CORNER TIES] The zipper closure makes your duvet cover easier to use. We have a flap to cover the zipper so that it is invisible and durable, making no noises during moving. Meanwhile, 4 corner ties inside your duvet cover can help secure comforter(or duvet insert) in the right place from slipping and keep you comfortable all night long. [EASY CLEANING & SERVICE] Close the zipper closure and machine washed at room temperature with a laundry bag on gentle cycle. Air dry or Tumble dry low heat. Do not bleach and iron. Better wash before first use. Every washing will make it softer. If you have any needs or questions, let us know by amazon email and we will give you a timely solution. Your shopping experience is our first priority. [WHAT YOU CAN RECEIVE] QUEEN SIZE DUVET COVER SET: 2 envelope pillowcases (20 x 26 inch), 1 zipper duvet cover (90 x 90 inch). KING SIZE DUVET COVER SET: 2 envelope pillowcases (20 x 36 inch), 1 zipper duvet cover (104 x 90 inch). Noting that Pillow insert, Duvet insert or Comforter is not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eJSLj5BKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Andency","source_asin":"B08FHQWY5W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FHQWY5W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FHQWY5W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
