window.products.push({"id":950930,"name":"GROSCHE Milano Stove top espresso maker (9 espresso cup size 15.2 oz) White, and battery operated milk frother bundle for lattes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wsxra0enL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐ [ Moka Espresso Coffee and Latte Kit ] Stovetop espresso maker, Moka pot, & manual coffee percolator machine. Available in 3 cups, 6 cups, 9 cup sizes. Stove top percolator coffee pot to make home espresso like a barista. Its easier to use than electric espresso coffee machines and makes a rich cup of espresso moka coffee. 3 cup expresso coffee maker stovetop size in Food grade anodized aluminium espresso Coffee maker. With the milk frother you can make Lattes. ⭐ [ Easy to use Moka Espresso coffee Maker & Cuban Coffee maker] will work on all gas and electric stove top and propane camping stoves as well. It makes moka coffee on glass top induction stoves but will heat very slowly since its not magnetic. It is a type of easy to use stovetop espresso maker, coffee perculator, or expresso coffee maker stovetop. Its also called a Moka pot, Moka coffe maker, or Cafetera Cubana. ⭐ [ Combine your moka coffee with rich milk froth to make Lattes easily at home ] You can easily make a moka latte coffee, by frothing 1% milk with the milk frother, and adding the moka coffee to it. ⭐ [ Easy to use battery operated milk frother with stainless steel frothing wand ] The GROSCHE EZ Latte milk frother has a stainless steel frothing wand which can be rinsed under running water after use. The frother uses 2x standard AA batteries (not included) and it has a high efficiency motor for battery saving technology to extend battery life. ⭐ [ Multi function milk frother for milk, egg whites, soups, dressings etc ] The EZ Latte milk frother is a multi function frother that can whish egg whites, salad dressings, and even be used as a matcha whisk. It is one of the most useful kitchen gadgets especially for true coffee lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wsxra0enL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GROSCHE","source_asin":"B08KRH1CZ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-950930","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KRH1CZ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KRH1CZ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
